<title>UK: DePfa sets 250 billion lire two-year FRN.</title>
<headline>DePfa sets 250 billion lire two-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Cariplo, IMI Bank Lux SA and Banca Populare di Milano.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    250 BLN LIRE  MARGIN    -0.125 PCT MATURITY    05.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M-LIBOR  PAY DATE  L-03.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	ISS PRICE  100.17    PAY FREQ    QUARTERLY</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (M) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   GROSS UP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
